Description: NetworkManager binding for python-sdbus
 Typed asynchronous and blocking Python interfaces to the NetworkManager
 D-Bus API, built on python-sdbus: devices, connections, access points,
 settings and the other objects NetworkManager exposes.
 .
 Packaged in the UniTotem repository because Debian does not ship it.
